  "term": "infant test",
  "definition": "In this packet, “infant test” refers to the Children’s Hospital of Philadelphia Infant Test of Neuromuscular Disorders (CHOP INTEND). It is a measure used to assess motor function level in children with type 1 spinal muscular atrophy.",
